.\" Manual page for dstp
.Dd August 15, 2026
.Dt DSTP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dstp
.Nd run parallel network connectivity checks
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl a Ar addr
.Op Fl o Ar plaintext|json
.Op Fl p Ar count
.Op Fl t Ar seconds
.Op Fl -port Ar port
.Op Fl -dns Ar server
.Op Fl -doh
.Op Fl -insecure
.Op Fl -extra
.Op Fl -skip Ar list
.Op Fl -config Ar path
.Op Fl q
.Op Fl v
.Op Fl h
.Ar target
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
probes a hostname, IP, or URL with parallel checks:
ping, DNS, records, TCP, UDP, TLS, HTTP, and HTTPS.
Optional
.Fl -extra
adds traceroute, whois, and MTU probes when those tools are installed.
.Pp
A full URL such as
.Ql https://host:8443/health?q=1
preserves scheme, port, path, and query for HTTP(S) checks.
.Sh OPTIONS
See
.Nm
.Fl h
for the complete flag list. Important flags:
.Bl -tag -width insecure
.It Fl -insecure
Skip TLS certificate verification (security risk).
.It Fl -skip Ar list
Comma-separated check IDs to skip.
.It Fl -config Ar path
YAML config file. Default:
.Pa $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/dstp/config.yaml
(or platform equivalent via
.Fn UserConfigDir ).
Missing default config is ignored; a missing explicit
.Fl -config
path is an error.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width XX
.It 0
Success, or help/version requested.
.It 1
One or more checks failed.
.It 2
Invalid usage or configuration.
.It 130
Interrupted (Ctrl-C).
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ping 8 ,
.Xr traceroute 8 ,
.Xr whois 1
